  {
    "id": "plural-nouns",
    "title": "Plural of Nouns",
    "text": "Add **-s** if the word ends in a vowel, **-es** if it ends in a consonant.\n\n- libro → libro**s**\n- casa → casa**s**\n- ciudad → ciudad**es**\n- pared → pared**es**\n\nWords ending in **-z** change z → c: *lápiz → lápices*, *vez → veces*.\nWords ending in **-ión** lose the accent: *canción → canciones*.\n\nIf the last syllable is stressed and ends in a vowel, add **-es**: *rubí → rubíes*.",
    "table": [
      [
        "Singular",
        "Plural",
        "Rule"
      ],
      [
        "libro",
        "libros",
        "vowel → +s"
      ],
      [
        "casa",
        "casas",
        "vowel → +s"
      ],
      [
        "ciudad",
        "ciudades",
        "consonant → +es"
      ],
      [
        "lápiz",
        "lápices",
        "z → c + es"
      ],
      [
        "canción",
        "canciones",
        "-ión → -iones"
      ]
    ],
