    "id": "reflexive-verbs",
    "title": "Reflexive Verbs",
    "text": "The action returns to the subject: **me, te, se, nos, os, se**.\n\n- *Me lavo.* (I wash myself) · *Se llama Ana.* (She calls herself Ana)\n- *Me levanto a las siete.* (I get up at seven)\n\nPlacement: before a conjugated verb, or attached to an infinitive/gerund:\n*Voy a **acostarme*** = *Me voy a **acostar*** = *Estoy **acostándome***.\n\nCareful: *llamarse* = \"to be called\"; *despertarse* (e→ie) = \"to wake up\".",
