    "id": "gustar",
    "title": "Gustar and Similar Verbs",
    "text": "**Gustar** literally means \"to please\": the thing liked is the subject.\n\n- *Me gusta el café.* (Coffee pleases me → I like coffee)\n- *Me gustan los libros.* (plural → gustan)\n- *Me gusta leer.* (an infinitive is singular)\n\nPronouns: **me, te, le, nos, os, les**.\nSame pattern: *encantar* (love), *interesar*, *importar*, *doler* (hurt — *me duele la cabeza*), *faltar*, *apetecer*.\n\nWith a clarifying phrase: *A mí me gusta...*, *A él le gusta...*",
